8a83efeacd3e26b82be495e17d50146e31c96a60 app/utils/zhconv.py. That dependency is
zhconv-rs 0.4.1, tag v0.4.1, commit 00e1e97fcf49865b49166c302651e419289fb3d1.
Source: https://github.com/Gowee/zhconv-rs/tree/00e1e97fcf49865b49166c302651e419289fb3d1
