by upstream's build.rs parse_mediawiki/sort_and_dedup algorithm from MediaWiki
includes/languages/data/ZhConversion.php at ecf4342132cf089ac0c42436827e9038a738bb6f
(SHA-256 5cb0019b32bb39ec5c6e662029f90bd166f7a844efb3bc877f9be41fdd511bf2).
