No OpenCC data, Rust runtime, Python runtime, or external conversion service is used.

Source binding and development-only extraction/oracle tools:
testdata/plugin-host-integration-20261031/zhconv/.
Only the zh-hans target used by the plugin recognition host is implemented.
Inline description (D) clauses use a deterministic order because the upstream
Rust HashMap order is randomized. Clause contents and all other conversion
semantics, including quirks of global removal and depth limiting, are retained.
